sequenceDiagram
    participant EHR as De-Identification Requester<br/>(EHR)
    participant MGR as De-ID Manager
    participant DI as De-Identifier
    participant LAB as Pathology Lab<br/>(external)

    Note over EHR,MGR: Care-context authorization and pseudonymization policy exist

    EHR->>MGR: ITI-x1 Submit De-Identification Job (sync)
    activate MGR
    Note over MGR: Validate authorization and policy<br/>Compile plan for Patient and ServiceRequest

    MGR->>DI: ITI-x3 Submit De-Identification Task (sync)
    activate DI
    Note over DI: Assign pseudonym and preserve<br/>ServiceRequest subject linkage
    DI-->>MGR: 200 OK (result, evidence, protected generatedLookupTable)
    deactivate DI

    Note over MGR: Validate output and retain<br/>the mapping before release
    MGR-->>EHR: ITI-x1 200 OK (pseudonymized result and evidence)
    deactivate MGR

    EHR->>LAB: Send pseudonymized order (outside DIS)
    LAB-->>EHR: Lab result referencing pseudonym (outside DIS)
    EHR->>MGR: Authorized pseudonym resolution request (implementation-defined, outside DIS Phase 1)
    MGR-->>EHR: Resolution result needed for patient association (no mapping-table export)
    Note over EHR: File lab result to patient chart
